rge silently corrupts a metric); raw name and lineage kept on every record;\nunknown names go to a review queue with volume counts, never dropped; history is re-mapped by a batch job over the lake; correctness is measured (coverage %, collision audit, dual-write during migration).", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The follow-up that sinks candidates: legacy clients emit several names for the same metric.\nAnswer: canonical id assigned at ingest from a versioned, reviewed alias table (no fuzzy or ML merging: a wrong merge silently corrupts a metric); raw name and lineage kept on every record;\nunknown names go to a review queue with volume counts, never dropped; history is re-mapped by a batch job over the lake; correctness is measured (coverage %, collision audit, dual-write during migration).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "7ipjSQ6KznMqIqK4xdER", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 1080, "width": 52.800000000000004, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "B7WCax11vAizSBoBjcJv", "index": "a0065", "roundness": null, "seed": 745702611, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1595166868, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436674039, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Legend", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Legend", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "IzECVAcekv3DAmccptRY", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 1110, "width": 22, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frame