39, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "storage, registry", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "storage, registry", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ZbQY4oLBmXqCD3aEObgx", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1570, "y": 1110, "width": 22, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fef9c3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "B7WCax11vAizSBoBjcJv", "index": "a0076", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1716521359, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2143554308, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436674039, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "CMVzZ8UMcGFRCqTvFXNn", "type": "text", "x": 1600, "y": 1111, "width": 71.5, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "B7WCax11vAizSBoBjcJv", "index": "a0077", "roundness": null, "seed": 1324588452, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2121765526, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436674039, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "governance", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "governance", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Xv0v8fyAx5V2u8yk369w", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -60, "width": 554.4000000000001, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0078", "roundness": null, "seed": 1457157480, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1969028642, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436674039, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stakeholders (ask which matter)\nAnalytics/BI: hourly and daily aggregates\nProduct apps: low-latency derived metrics\nData science: ad-hoc, sampling, backfills\nCompliance: access control + audit across public/internal/restricted/PII", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Stakeholders (ask which matter)\nAnalytics/BI: hourly and daily aggregates\nProduct apps: low-latency derived metrics\nData science: ad-hoc, sampling, backfills\nCompliance: access control + audit across public/internal/restricted/PII", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "qeFuNpExn5ntu6N0qn6d", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 67.5, "width": 492.80000000000007, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0079", "roundness": null, "seed": 2077483988, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1219987779, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436674039, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Functional requirements\nIngest server events, logs, DB change feeds, third-party files\nValidate schema, dedupe, idempotent on event id\nStream (p95 < 5 min) and batch (T+1) processing\nServe SQL, APIs, pre-aggregations, exports; isolate workloads\nRow/column/table policies by sensitivity tag; audit every access", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Functional requirements\nIngest server events, logs, DB change feeds, third-party files\nValidate schema, dedupe, idempotent on event id\nStream (p95 < 5 min) and batch (T+1) processing\nServe SQL, APIs, pre-aggregations, exports; isolate workloads\nRow/column/table policies by sensitivity tag; audit every access", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "IV9tROP5GDa6XiKX779Q", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 212.5, "width": 454.3, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0080", "roundness": null, "seed": 979923616, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1853409330, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436674039, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers to state\nEvents/s \u00d7 bytes \u00d7 retention \u2192 ingest and storage sizing\nRetention: 7 d hot, 1\u20133 y cold; query concurrency 100\u20131,000\nCardinality budget per metric (labels \u00d7 values)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers to state\nEvents/s \u00d7 bytes \u00d7 retention \u2192 ingest and storage sizing\nRetention: 7 d hot, 1\u20133 y cold; query concurrency 100\u20131,000\nCardinality budget per metric (labels \u00d7 values)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "INVIWsWAiPZYMWxrPcrd", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 322.5, "width": 469.70000000000005, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0081", "roundness": null, "seed": 1697313650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 857467467, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436674039, "created": 1790436674039, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Failure and growth\nDuplicates and replay \u2192 idempotent transforms, dead-letter\nLate and out-of-order events \u2192 watermarks\nBad data blast radius \u2192 quarantine, versioned mapping, re-run\nGrowth \u2192 partition by day and source, compaction, tiering", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure and growth\nDuplicates and replay \u2192 idempotent transforms, dead-letter\nLate and out-of-order events \u2192 watermarks\nBad data blast radius \u2192 quarantine, versioned mapping, re-run\nGrowth \u2192 partition by day and source, compaction, tiering", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}